{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2025-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1765238400, "end_date": 1765843199, "month_true_total": 88, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:13:35 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "213358912", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148218149", "personaname": "ＴＲＡＳＨ", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148218149/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2027, "last_played": 1772511104, "avatar": "9975b1c17f27681de458b3ace8c2fc711816d9a8"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "duro", "timestamp_created": 1765812587, "timestamp_updated": 1765812587, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213328096", "author": {"steamid": "76561199021962215", "personaname": "CARH", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199021962215/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 15988, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13772, "last_played": 1780298947, "avatar": "3d5e1e47970020a66cc6d528c5cc1921bf675285"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Muy divertido y siempre hay gente para jugar.\nBásicamente tu y tus compañeros son enanos mineros del futuro con ametralladoras, siguen misiones que representan distintas actividades para jugar, minar algún recurso especifico, construir y reparar una refinería, derrotar bestias gigantescas, etc. Todo esto mientras tu y tu equipo luchan contra hordas de insectos alienígenas en las cuevas.\n\nLo que lo hace aún mas divertido es el hecho de que puedes jugar con otras personas, apoyar al equipo en el combate o en la reparación de una maquina mejora el desempeño del mismo.\n\nSi bien el gameplay brilla mas en equipo con otros jugadores, te puedes divertir igual jugando solo.\nLo unico que me entristece, es que no se puede jugar en pantalla dividida con amigos a pesar de que este juego seria perfecto en ese modo.", "timestamp_created": 1765768363, "timestamp_updated": 1774832867, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492837667465209961", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213315912", "author": {"steamid": "76561198275011699", "personaname": "Wixxo77", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198275011699/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2623, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1753, "last_played": 1773986328, "avatar": "bc3121a98deb180864f206aacb827f6052f461f6"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "enanos \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1765752327, "timestamp_updated": 1765752327, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "213245730", "author": {"steamid": "76561199443249678", "personaname": "aemede50", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199443249678/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 390, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 213, "last_played": 1766279308, "avatar": "0e96fd1da4c91017a7c1de980d6361b139e6831d"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "me gusta fumar ro